.analytics AppRoute via AppRouteParser.aliases ("/statistics": .analytics, already present). The .analytics route
was previously UNREGISTERED (no page owned its host); StatisticsRouteRegistration.registry(.analytics) now fills it,
so /statistics deep-links + the Insights sidebar entry render the page. No AppRoute case was added or displaced; the
parser, every sibling Admin/FleetCompare route, and the registry chain are otherwise untouched. The page model is
built @MainActor in the registration enum and captured, mirroring the sibling *RouteRegistration enums.

